    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "gpu-upgrade",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Phase 2: GPU Path (Fedora 44 bare-metal)\n",
        "\n",
        "On bare-metal with GTX 1650 (or better), the GLSL compute shader runs natively:\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "%%glsl\n",
        "#version 450\n",
        "layout(local_size_x = 256) in;\n",
        "\n",
        "struct Particle7D { vec3 position; float scalar; vec3 momentum; uint tribe_id; };\n",
        "layout(set=0, binding=0) buffer P { Particle7D data[]; } particles;\n",
        "\n",
        "void main() {\n",
        "    uint idx = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;\n",
        "    // ... physics update on GPU ...\n",
        "}\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Phase 3: Scale to **1 billion particles** with multi-GPU and Barnes-Hut O(N log N)."
      ]
    }
  ]
